title: Status
new-page: true
is-special: true
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.unemployed) {
    Q.unemployed_2 = Q.unemployed.toFixed(1);
}
if (Q.inflation) {
    Q.inflation_2 = Q.inflation.toFixed(1);
}
Q.economic_growth_2 = '0';
if (Q.economic_growth) {
    Q.economic_growth_2 = Q.economic_growth.toFixed(1);
}
!}

= Status

[+ month : month +] [+ year +]

Verfügbare Ressourcen: [+ resources +]

Rolle der SPD: [? if spd_toleration : Tolerierung ?][? if spd_in_government : in der Regierung - ?][? if spd_toleration == 0 and spd_in_government == 0 and spd_caretaker == 0 : Opposition ?][? if spd_caretaker : geschäftsführende Regierung ?]
[? if in_weimar_coalition and spd_in_government: Weimarer Koalition ?][? if in_grand_coalition and spd_in_government: Große Koalition ?][? if in_popular_front and spd_in_government: Volksfront ?][? if in_left_front and spd_in_government: Linksfront ?][? if in_spd_majority and spd_in_government: SPD-Mehrheitsregierung ?][? if in_minority_government and spd_in_government: Minderheitsregierung ?][? if in_emergency_government and spd_in_government: Notstandsregierung ?]

[? if spd_in_government and not in_spd_majority and not in_left_front : Unzufriedenheit innerhalb der Koalition: [+ coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

[? if spd_in_government and (in_left_front or in_popular_front): Unzufriedenheit innerhalb der KPD Koalition: [+ kpd_coalition_dissent : coalition_dissent +] ?]

Interne Unzufriedenheit: [+ dissent_percent : dissent +]

= Regierung

Präsident: [+ president +]

Kanzler: [+ chancellor +] ([+ chancellor_party +])

Reichstags Zusammensetzung:

# 1928: 30, 1930: 25, 1932: 22
{!<span class="tooltip-text" title="Sozialdemokratische Partei Deutschlands">SPD</span>!}: [+ spd_r +]%
[? if sapd_formed and sapd_r > 0: SAPD: [+ sapd_r +]% ?]
# 1928: 15, 1930: 15, 1932: 
